Outlier Analysis:


Q1:
Q1 = df["Final_Sales"].quantile(0.25)
Q3:
Q3 = df["Final_Sales"].quantile(0.75)
IQR:
IQR = Q3 - Q1
Lower Bound:
lower_bound = Q1 - 1.5 * IQR
Upper Bound:
upper_bound = Q3 + 1.5 * IQR
Identify Outliers:
outliers = df[
    (df["Final_Sales"] < lower_bound) |
    (df["Final_Sales"] > upper_bound)
]
